dovecot-vpopmail (2.4.1-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging: dovecot 2.4 IMAP with vpopmail MySQL authentication.
  * Configures dovecot to authenticate against the vpopmail MySQL database
    using the SQL passdb driver (dovecot 2.4 removed vpopmail/checkpassword
    passdb drivers).
  * mail_location resolves to ~/Maildir where ~ is pw_dir from MySQL.
  * TLS enabled using the certificate generated by the qmail package.
  * Target: Debian 13 Trixie.

 -- Brian O'Reilly <fade@deepsky.com>  Sat, 21 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000
